---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PostRow from '../components/PostRow.astro';
import Status from '../components/Status.astro';
import ChildSaPreview from '../components/ChildSaPreview.astro';
import '../styles/home.css';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import { pathFor } from '../lib/paths';
import { site } from '../lib/site';
const posts=await getCollection('posts',({data})=>!data.draft);
const firstPost=posts.find(p=>p.id==='strongswan-child-sa-xfrm')!;
const corePosts=['strongswan-config-ike-sa','strongswan-ip-packet-esp'].map(id=>posts.find(p=>p.id===id)!);
const [titleSubject,...titleRest]=firstPost.data.title.split('：');
---
<Base>
  <div class="shell journal-home">
    <header class="journal-intro">
      <div><h1>congroo 的技术笔记</h1><p>Linux 内核 · IPsec / TLS · 高性能网络</p></div>
      <a class="journal-search" href={pathFor('articles/#search')}>检索文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>
    <p class="home-method">我做密码网关研发。沿着一个包的路径，追踪协议状态、密码材料与 Linux 数据面如何交接。</p>
    <div class="journal-layout">
      <div class="journal-main">
        <article class="featured-post">
          <div class="section-label"><span class="editorial-label">重点阅读</span><span>strongSwan 五链 / 内核交接</span><span class="featured-evidence-label">附关联实验摘要</span></div>
          <h2><a href={pathFor(`articles/${firstPost.id}/`)} aria-label={firstPost.data.title}><span class="title-subject">{titleSubject}<span class="title-colon">：</span></span><span class="title-detail">{titleRest.join('：')}</span></a></h2>
          <div class="featured-body has-evidence">
            <div class="featured-copy">
              <p class="featured-description">{firstPost.data.description}</p>
              <p class="featured-takeaway"><span>这里最容易混淆的边界</span>charon 完成协商，Linux XFRM 处理业务包。密码库接入控制面后，数据面究竟走哪套实现，需要沿接口继续追踪。</p>
              <a class="feature-read" href={pathFor(`articles/${firstPost.id}/`)}>阅读全文 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><small>约 {firstPost.data.minutes} 分钟</small></a>
            </div>
            <ChildSaPreview/>
          </div>
          <div class="featured-footnote"><Status state="source"/><a href={pathFor('lab/ipsec-single-vm-evidence/')}>关联实验：XFRM 与 ESP 的对应关系 ↗</a></div>
          <p class="featured-boundary">源码基线与运行版本分别标注。日志支持具体观察，不替代逐函数调用跟踪。</p>
        </article>
        <section class="journal-entries" aria-labelledby="more-writing">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="more-writing">把前后两段接起来</h2><a href={pathFor('journey/')}>技术框架图 ↗</a></div>
          <p class="series-introduction">从配置创建状态，到协商结果进入内核，再到真实业务包。首页选这三篇，是因为它们能放在同一条路径上核对。</p>
          {corePosts.map(post=><PostRow post={post} compact/>)}
        </section>
        <section class="home-lab" aria-labelledby="home-lab-title">
          <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="home-lab-title">一次实际运行的记录</h2><a href={pathFor('lab/')}>实验台账 ↗</a></div>
          <p class="lab-dateline"><span>运行于 <time datetime="2026-09-23">2026-09-23</time></span><span>作者已亲自操作 · 历史记录归档</span></p>
          <h3><a href={pathFor('lab/ipsec-single-vm-evidence/')}>单虚拟机 IPsec 实验：协商、XFRM 与 ESP ↗</a></h3>
          <p>单虚拟机、四个网络命名空间。把双向 SPI、XFRM 计数和真实业务流量对上，也留下 proposal 不匹配时的失败输出。</p>
          <p class="lab-limit">原始记录暂不公开。抓包只覆盖首对 ESP，这个缺口在摘要中明确保留。</p>
        </section>
        <section class="archive-door" aria-labelledby="archive-door-title">
          <div><h2 id="archive-door-title">完整资料库</h2><p>VPN 技术原稿、源码笔记与待审阅的补充研究。按系列、主题或函数名查找。</p></div><a href={pathFor('articles/')}>打开文章与原稿档案 →</a>
          <details><summary>关于日期和稿件状态</summary><p>原稿留档、本站收录、后续修订分别记录。原稿、AI 辅助补充稿与真实实验分开标注；文档数量不表示研究已全部完成。</p></details>
        </section>
      </div>
      <aside class="journal-aside">
        <section class="current-research">
          <h2>当前研究</h2><p class="research-focus">strongSwan / XFRM</p>
          <p>先把配置、IKE 协商、内核 SA 与业务包的关系说清楚。已有单机隧道记录，下一步补完整抓包与运行版本证据。</p>
          <a href={pathFor('journey/#ipsec')}>在系统栈里看这条路径 ↗</a>
        </section>
        <section class="author-note">
          <h2>关于这个人</h2><p>congroo，密码网关工程实践者。这里记录源码阅读、技术判断，以及判断被修正的依据。</p>
          <a href={pathFor('about/')}>当前阶段与交流方向 ↗</a>
          <div class="author-links"><a href={site.github}>GitHub ↗</a><a href={pathFor('subscribe/')}>RSS ↗</a></div>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
